Yes. Each task is one line: item({delta:{"p-<id>":{tasks:{add:{title,description}}}}}). Start and complete are more lines on that task's id. Nothing is made client side.

```
prompt p-1
  tasks.add {title, description}
  p-1.t-1.start {}
  p-1.t-1.complete {outcome, evidence, confidence, caveats}
```

